WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
You want the good news or the bad news?

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.040
Bad news first.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.040
Every call you miss is a customer

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.160
who just called someone else.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.520
And chasing every lead yourself?

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.520
That's the late nights, the weekends,

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.040
the dinners you promised you'd be home for.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.200
Here's the good news.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.240
We build the systems that catch it all.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.280
Websites that sell, a voice that answers every call,

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:23.960
software that does the rest.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.800
The revenue comes back.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:26.880
And you?

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.160
You finally get to be right here.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.960
Daddy!

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:31.960
Chuckles.
